  <main_text>
    <l n="1">&amp; Agricultura tanquam fuperius de in-</l>
    <l n="2">feriori:quoniam fpecies oppofitæ defe</l>
    <l n="3">affirmative prædicari non poffunt.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Poftquam rationes Plempii folvimus,</l>
    <l n="5">age nunc rationes contrarias affertioni</l>
    <l n="6">ejufdem pro communi &amp; vera fenten-</l>
    <l n="7">tia proponamus, &amp; ab exceptionibus</l>
    <l n="8">vindicemus.Sit noftra prima ratio hæc:</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Illud eft objectum proprium Medicina,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>in quod primo &amp; propter fe quaritur</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>arte induci fanitas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>Sed in corpus humanum primo &amp; pro-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>pter fe quaritur arte induci fanitas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Ergo.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Et in contrariam partem :</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Illud non eft objectum Medicina, cui</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>non primo &amp; propter fe quaritur arte</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>fanitas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>Sed omni corpori viventi non primo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>&amp; propter fe quaritur arte fanitas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Ergo.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Ratio majoris eft : quia finis artes</l>
    <l n="23">menfurat,&amp; fui fubjecti caufa quaritur.</l>
    <l n="24">Minor autem patet ex notabili 4.&amp;</l>
    <l n="25">5.&amp; conjunganrur quæ in meth.mea p. 147</l>
    <l n="26">&amp; feq. de eadem materia notavi.</l>
    <l n="27" para="true">Contra argumentum hoc aliqua</l>
    <l n="28">Plempius objecit, fed ea circa notabile</l>
    <l n="29">4. foluta funt. Sit ergo hæc fecunda</l>
    <l n="30">ratio :</l>
